"""
graph.py — LangGraph chatbot with human-in-the-loop for send_email

Flow:
  chat_node → [tool calls?]
    → NO  → END
    → YES → [is send_email?]
                → YES → email_approval_node (interrupt) → [approved?]
                              → YES → tool_node → chat_node
                              → NO  → chat_node (cancelled)
                → NO  → tool_node → chat_node

Scheduler (APScheduler):
  Every 10 minutes → _scheduled_check_updates() fetches important emails
  and sends a notification email if anything important is found.
  Call start_scheduler() / stop_scheduler() from main.py lifespan.
"""

